    "updated_at": "2024-01-24T12:09:03Z",
    "body": "Implementing this in Chromium has uncovered some significant bugs in the anti-abuse logic of close watchers. The new proposed spec allows infinite back-trapping, and the existing spec didn't have enough test coverage. A more significant overhaul will be needed. I think I have something almost working...",
